#+Begin_teacher

Hi! today we are going to learn the main concept of Chess the *checkmate*. 
Here is an starting position. 
Find the checkmate!

#+End_teacher

#+Begin_tips

- As you may notice black King is in trouble, seems like he is standing on a corridor without exit. Any idea to block it having the King without any escape? 

#+End_tips

#+Begin_move_list

PGN: 1. Rc8#

That's correct, you found the checkmate, this is called the "Back rank (or Corridor) mate.

PGN: 1. *

Sorry this is not the move, try again.

